@startuml
!theme plain

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 180
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

title Backend Service Architecture

actor "Frontend / Client" as Client

rectangle "External Boundary" {
  component "nginx API Gateway\nREST/HTTP entrypoint\nauth check\nreverse proxy" as Nginx
}

rectangle "Backend Services" {
  component "Symfony Main Service\nAuth\nAdmin\nNews\nNotifications" as Symfony
  queue "RabbitMQ\nlocal async messages" as RabbitMQ
  component "Catalog Service\nREST/HTTP API\nInternal gRPC client/server" as Catalog
  component "Order/Cart Service\nREST/HTTP API\nInternal gRPC client/server" as Orders
}

database "Main/Auth/Admin/News DB" as MainDb
database "Catalog DB" as CatalogDb
database "Orders DB" as OrdersDb

Client --> Nginx : REST/HTTP
Nginx --> Symfony : auth check
Symfony --> Nginx : X-User-Id / X-User-Role

Nginx --> Symfony : REST/HTTP\nAuth/Admin/News
Nginx --> Catalog : REST/HTTP\ntrusted identity headers
Nginx --> Orders : REST/HTTP\ntrusted identity headers

Symfony --> MainDb : owns
Symfony --> RabbitMQ : publish async events/messages
RabbitMQ --> Symfony : consume async messages
Catalog --> CatalogDb : owns
Orders --> OrdersDb : owns

Catalog <--> Orders : internal gRPC
Orders <--> Symfony : internal gRPC where needed
Catalog <--> Symfony : internal gRPC where needed

note right of Nginx
External gateway responsibilities:
- receive client REST/HTTP
- validate auth through Symfony
- overwrite identity headers
- proxy original REST request
end note

note bottom of Catalog
gRPC is internal service-to-service transport only.
External clients do not call gRPC directly.
end note

note right of RabbitMQ
Current scope:
- local async/event-driven processing
- inside Symfony Main Service
- not an inter-service event bus yet
end note

@enduml
